; M201 — raise the dust hood.
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M201 modalgroup=10 ngc=m201
; Pulses motion.digital-out-02 (M64/M65 P2) onto the reset pin of the
; dust-hood flipflop in io.hal, which holds the hood position and drives the
; solenoids (io-dout3.dout-3 down, dout-2 up). A pulse rather than a level so
; the PyVCP toggle button keeps working after this. M200 does the opposite.

o<m201> sub
  M64 P2
  G4 P0.05
  M65 P2
o<m201> endsub
M2
